import test from'node:test';import assert from'node:assert/strict';import fs from'node:fs/promises';import path from'node:path';import os from'node:os';import{createHash}from'node:crypto';import{createRequire}from'node:module';import{fileURLToPath}from'node:url';import{EventEmitter}from'node:events';import{compileNativeLinks}from'./native-link.mjs';import{executeNative}from'./native.mjs';
const here=path.dirname(fileURLToPath(import.meta.url)),stage=path.resolve(here,'../../../../..'),cache=process.env.FLOW_ORIGINAL_CACHE;if(!cache||!path.isAbsolute(cache))throw new Error('Explicit owned original cache absolute path required; copied historical relative comparator is not used.');const sha=b=>createHash('sha256').update(b).digest('hex'),observations=[],out=process.env.FLOW_LINK_OBSERVATIONS??path.join(os.tmpdir(),'rea-link-observations-'+process.pid);await fs.mkdir(out,{recursive:true});
const pins={'@node-red/nodes/core/common/60-link.js':'932313fc797b77dc80fb27869ad23b1c0f6491e34d7ea5b2525a2ce046a06b03','@node-red/runtime/lib/flows/util.js':'7881b34a1056bd2e75c132038e2d8e4acb5213165541be85fa40a8a4fcd0b87e','@node-red/nodes/core/common/20-inject.js':'2d68ffe7fb53f58658533a58256159f57009989d2e0b386d7a9a384e9587e8ec','@node-red/nodes/core/function/15-change.js':'e7cda0e39bd1a7968c3ac2ccb2efe73e0fb70dc5fc3302f7e7392d550111d066','@node-red/util/lib/util.js':'07ec8410cb31fafecaa886d6c3d1ff3381e7fce802a5d7cd6088db5d11d5df57','@node-red/runtime/lib/nodes/Node.js':'4931ee2e41d4246d51b42c55bb9d7d020ac84601a9e70dff6e70946c23fdf4be','node-red-node-test-helper/index.js':'1c3b1f4670480eb18cfd4a9dea46222c06abd0721be20d921015de6de0a4aa19'};
async function authenticate(){const lock=await fs.readFile(path.join(here,'fixtures/oracle/package-lock.json'));assert.equal(sha(lock),'75f9e5c0448cb753d2fd4b735698dbb2dc8bb310534ac8e4548618baca612de1');assert.ok(lock.equals(await fs.readFile(path.join(cache,'package-lock.json'))));for(const[p,h]of Object.entries(pins))assert.equal(sha(await fs.readFile(path.join(cache,'node_modules',p))),h);return{lockSHA256:sha(lock),sourcePins:pins};}
const authority=await authenticate(),require=createRequire(path.join(cache,'package.json'));test.after(async()=>{await authenticate();await fs.writeFile(path.join(out,'link-original.json'),JSON.stringify({authority,observations,originalGUI:0,originalEditor:0,benchmarks:0},null,2)+'\n');});
const clone=v=>Buffer.isBuffer(v)?Buffer.from(v):v instanceof Date?new Date(v):Array.isArray(v)?v.map(clone):v&&typeof v==='object'?Object.fromEntries(Object.entries(v).map(([k,x])=>[k,clone(x)])):v;
function base(){return[{id:'tab',type:'tab'},{id:'start',type:'inject',z:'tab',x:100,y:100,props:[],wires:[['out']]},{id:'out',type:'link out',z:'tab',x:200,y:100,links:['in'],wires:[['ignored']]},{id:'in',type:'link in',z:'tab',x:300,y:100,links:['out'],wires:[['debug']]},{id:'debug',type:'debug',z:'tab',x:400,y:100,complete:'true',active:true,tosidebar:true}];}
test('exact released parseConfig compiles finite static-link unions/order/omitted-list cases without adapting its algorithm',async()=>{const util=require('@node-red/runtime/lib/flows/util.js'),cases=[];for(const value of[undefined,null,false,0,'',[],['in'],['in','in']]){const nodes=base();if(value===undefined)delete nodes[2].links;else nodes[2].links=value;cases.push({name:'out-links-'+JSON.stringify(value),nodes});}const integer=base();integer[2].links=['z','10','2','z'];integer[3].id='z';integer.push({id:'10',type:'link in',z:'tab',x:300,y:200,links:['out'],wires:[['debug']]},{id:'2',type:'link in',z:'tab',x:300,y:300,links:['out'],wires:[['debug']]});cases.push({name:'integer-order',nodes:integer});for(const item of cases){const original=clone(item.nodes);util.parseConfig(original);const candidate=compileNativeLinks(item.nodes);const expected=original.filter(n=>n.type==='link out').map(n=>({id:n.id,wires:n.wires})),actual=[...candidate.nodes.values()].filter(n=>n.type==='link out').map(n=>({id:n.id,wires:n.wires}));observations.push({kind:'released-compiler',name:item.name,expected,actual});assert.deepEqual(actual,expected);}});
test('actual released Link In/Out handlers preserve messages and default/falsy modes; original external event emission remains explicitly outside candidate runtime',async()=>{const registration=require('@node-red/nodes/core/common/60-link.js'),constructors=new Map(),events=new EventEmitter(),RED={nodes:{registerType:(name,c)=>constructors.set(name,c),createNode(node,n){node.id=n.id;node.handlers={};node.on=(key,fn)=>node.handlers[key]=fn;node.receive=()=>{};node.warn=()=>{};},linkcallTargets:{register(){},remove(){}}},events,_:v=>v};registration(RED);let count=0;for(const mode of[undefined,null,false,0,'','link']){const config={id:'out',...(mode===undefined?{}:{mode})},node=new(constructors.get('link out'))(config),message={_msgid:'fixed',payload:Buffer.from([0,128,255])};let sent,done=0,emitted=0;const observe=()=>emitted++;events.on('node:out',observe);node.handlers.input(message,m=>sent=m,()=>done++);events.removeListener('node:out',observe);assert.equal(sent,message);assert.equal(sent._event,'node:out');assert.equal(done,1);assert.equal(emitted,1);count++;observations.push({kind:'released-handler',name:'out-'+String(mode),mode:mode??null,sentEvent:sent._event,done,originalEventEmission:emitted});}const node=new(constructors.get('link in'))({id:'in',event:'external-only'}),message={_event:'kept',payload:new Date('2025-01-01T00:00:00Z')};let received,done=0;node.handlers.input(message,m=>received=m,()=>done++);assert.equal(received,message);assert.equal(received._event,'kept');assert.equal(done,1);observations.push({kind:'released-handler',name:'in-direct',done,event:received._event});assert.equal(count,6);});
test('real released Node-RED/test-helper flows agree with native static-link execution across tabs/branching/defaults',async t=>{const directory=await fs.mkdtemp(path.join(os.tmpdir(),'rea-link-original-runtime-'));let helper,started=false,init;const cwd=process.cwd();try{process.chdir(cache);helper=require('node-red-node-test-helper');}finally{process.chdir(cwd);}helper.init(require.resolve('node-red'),{logging:{console:{level:'off'}},userDir:directory,nodeMessageBufferMaxLength:1000});
 // The released helper hardcodes logging-only init arguments. This owned fixture
 // supplies a temporary userDir and disables the editor endpoint to the unchanged
 // original public initializer; no handler/compiler/flow algorithm is substituted.
 init=helper._RED.init;helper._RED.init=function(server,settings){return init.call(this,server,{...settings,userDir:directory,httpAdminRoot:false});};
 const modules=[require('@node-red/nodes/core/common/20-inject.js'),require('@node-red/nodes/core/function/15-change.js'),require('@node-red/nodes/core/common/60-link.js')],cases=[];for(const mode of[undefined,false,0,'']){const nodes=base();if(mode!==undefined)nodes[2].mode=mode;cases.push({name:'default-mode-'+String(mode),nodes,messages:[{_msgid:'fixed',payload:{nested:2}}]});}const incoming=base();incoming[2].links=[];cases.push({name:'incoming-only',nodes:incoming,messages:[{_msgid:'fixed',payload:Buffer.from([0,128,255])}]});const physical=base();delete physical[2].links;physical[2].wires=[['in']];cases.push({name:'physical-when-outlinks-missing',nodes:physical,messages:[{_msgid:'fixed',payload:new Date('2025-01-01T00:00:00Z')}]});const cross=base();cross.push({id:'other',type:'tab'});cross[3].z='other';cross[4].z='other';cases.push({name:'cross-tab',nodes:cross,messages:[{_msgid:'fixed',payload:'cross'}]});const fan=base();fan[2].links=['in','in','in2'];fan.push({id:'in2',type:'link in',z:'tab',x:300,y:200,links:['out'],wires:[['debug2']]},{id:'debug2',type:'debug',z:'tab',x:400,y:200,complete:'true',active:true,tosidebar:true});cases.push({name:'duplicate-fanout',nodes:fan,messages:[{_msgid:'fixed',payload:{branch:1}}]});
 try{await new Promise((r,j)=>helper.startServer(e=>e?j(e):r()));started=true;for(const item of cases){await authenticate();const config=clone(item.nodes).map(n=>n.type==='debug'?{id:n.id,type:'helper',z:n.z,x:n.x,y:n.y}:n);await helper.load(modules,config);const observed=[];for(const n of item.nodes.filter(n=>n.type==='debug'))helper.getNode(n.id).on('input',message=>observed.push({node:n.id,message:clone(message)}));for(const message of item.messages)helper.getNode('start').receive(clone(message));await new Promise(r=>setTimeout(r,30));const candidate=(await executeNative(JSON.stringify(item.nodes),{messages:clone(item.messages)})).debug.map(row=>({node:row.node,message:row.message}));observations.push({kind:'released-full-runtime',name:item.name,observed,candidate,fixture:{debugReplacedByObserverHelpers:true,originalCompilerAndHandlersUnmodified:true,ownedUserDir:true,initializerSettingsAdapter:true,host:'127.0.0.1 ephemeral'}});assert.deepEqual(candidate,observed);await helper.unload();}}finally{try{await helper.unload();if(started)await new Promise(r=>helper.stopServer(r));}finally{helper._RED.init=init;assert.equal(path.dirname(directory),path.resolve(os.tmpdir()));assert(path.basename(directory).startsWith('rea-link-original-runtime-'));await fs.rm(directory,{recursive:true,force:true});observations.push({kind:'cleanup',helperHostStopped:true,tempRemoved:true,originalCases:cases.length});}}});
